\description{
Run the hill-climber Monte Carlo (HCMC) algorithm (Castelo and
Kočka, 2003) on purely observational Gaussian data, or the interventional
HCMC (iHCMC) on mixed observational and interventional Gaussian data
(Castelo, 2026).
